{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>Battle Babes 4!</strong> We've thrown out the old playbook and rebuilt our solo battle AI from the ground up. Prepare to face a ruthless, faster, and more strategic opponent that learns your habits, punishes your misplays, and won't waste a single move. This isn't just a new chapter; it's a whole new war.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DEEPER STRATEGY, DEADLIER MECHANICS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Victory now demands more than a powerful deck\u2014it demands cunning. Battle Babes 4 introduces game-changing mechanics that rewrite the rules of combat:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Clone Cards:</strong> Duplicate the strongest cards on the battlefield for overwhelming force.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Swap the Stats:</strong> Turn a weak unit into a powerhouse by swapping its Attack and HP at the perfect moment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Overwhelm with Summons:</strong> Unleash new cards that flood the board with extra allies.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These new tools are essential to outsmart the advanced AI. Combine them with an arsenal of <strong>2,200 collectible cards</strong>\u00a0and <strong>60 Hero Powers</strong> like <strong>Myth, Mirror, and Magnetism</strong> to forge strategies your opponents won't see coming.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THE BATTLEGROUND AND BEYOND</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you need a break from outwitting the new AI, the lounge has expanded. Prove your bluffing skills in the all-new <strong>9-Player Poker</strong> mode, or relax with a massive suite of mini-games including Pool, Blackjack, Chess, and Space Invaders to earn resources for your next card pack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Track your entire journey with the new <strong>Collection Statistics</strong> screen. Monitor your progress, admire your collection, and plan your path to total deck domination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle Babes 4 isn't just more content\u2014it's a smarter, more challenging, and more dynamic strategic experience. The Babes have evolved. Have you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES REFORGED:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Completely Rebuilt Battle AI:</strong> Face a faster, fairer, and brutally efficient opponent in Solo Battle that will test even the most seasoned players.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game-Changing Card Mechanics:</strong> Master Cloning, Stat-Swapping, and new Summoning abilities to unlock unprecedented strategic depth.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An Exploded Arsenal:</strong> Command 60 Hero Decks and collect over 2,200 cards for limitless deckbuilding.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>New 9-Player Poker:</strong> Go all-in against a full table in our biggest mini-game addition yet.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progression Tracking:</strong> Monitor your collection stats and watch your power grow with our new player profile screen.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vast Mini-Game Suite:</strong> Earn gems and coins in Poker, Pool, Snooker, Chess, Brick Break, and many more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Satisfying Idle Progression:</strong> Power up your Babes and your empire even when you're not in the heat of battle. Earn card packs!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stunning NSFW Artwork:</strong> Collect and command hundreds of beautifully illustrated characters.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ultimate challenge awaits. Don't keep the new and improved Babes waiting. \ud83d\udc8b</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4000430?t=1757887406","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4000430/cd0c19c9fb6afc46e812aa5b74daacfd966bf6d0/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757887406","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4000430/b704910abf154e5322562c935994531af30f4c9b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757887406","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4000430/b704910abf154e5322562c935994531af30f4c9b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757887406","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,4,5],"notes":"Battle Babes features some seriously revealing outfits and veiled nudity. It's packed with suggestive themes, steamy scenarios, domination, and content that may not be appropriate for all audiences.\r\n\r\nSome artwork includes themes of light, fantasy-based bondage, such as characters being loosely bound by elements like spiky vines.\r\n\r\nCertain images depict characters with minor injuries (cuts, scrapes, scars) and in states of emotional distress (crying, sadness)."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>Battle Babes 4!</strong> We've thrown out the old playbook and rebuilt our solo battle AI from the ground up. Prepare to face a ruthless, faster, and more strategic opponent that learns your habits, punishes your misplays, and won't waste a single move. This isn't just a new chapter; it's a whole new war.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DEEPER STRATEGY, DEADLIER MECHANICS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Victory now demands more than a powerful deck\u2014it demands cunning. Battle Babes 4 introduces game-changing mechanics that rewrite the rules of combat:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Clone Cards:</strong> Duplicate the strongest cards on the battlefield for overwhelming force.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Swap the Stats:</strong> Turn a weak unit into a powerhouse by swapping its Attack and HP at the perfect moment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Overwhelm with Summons:</strong> Unleash new cards that flood the board with extra allies.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These new tools are essential to outsmart the advanced AI. Combine them with an arsenal of <strong>2,200 collectible cards</strong>\u00a0and <strong>60 Hero Powers</strong> like <strong>Myth, Mirror, and Magnetism</strong> to forge strategies your opponents won't see coming.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THE BATTLEGROUND AND BEYOND</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you need a break from outwitting the new AI, the lounge has expanded. Prove your bluffing skills in the all-new <strong>9-Player Poker</strong> mode, or relax with a massive suite of mini-games including Pool, Blackjack, Chess, and Space Invaders to earn resources for your next card pack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Track your entire journey with the new <strong>Collection Statistics</strong> screen. Monitor your progress, admire your collection, and plan your path to total deck domination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle Babes 4 isn't just more content\u2014it's a smarter, more challenging, and more dynamic strategic experience. The Babes have evolved. Have you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES REFORGED:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Completely Rebuilt Battle AI:</strong> Face a faster, fairer, and brutally efficient opponent in Solo Battle that will test even the most seasoned players.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game-Changing Card Mechanics:</strong> Master Cloning, Stat-Swapping, and new Summoning abilities to unlock unprecedented strategic depth.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An Exploded Arsenal:</strong> Command 60 Hero Decks and collect over 2,200 cards for limitless deckbuilding.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>New 9-Player Poker:</strong> Go all-in against a full table in our biggest mini-game addition yet.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progression Tracking:</strong> Monitor your collection stats and watch your power grow with our new player profile screen.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vast Mini-Game Suite:</strong> Earn gems and coins in Poker, Pool, Snooker, Chess, Brick Break, and many more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Satisfying Idle Progression:</strong> Power up your Babes and your empire even when you're not in the heat of battle. Earn card packs!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stunning NSFW Artwork:</strong> Collect and command hundreds of beautifully illustrated characters.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ultimate challenge awaits. Don't keep the new and improved Babes waiting. \ud83d\udc8b</p>","developers":["Recoil Mojo"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Sports","id":"18"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4000430/ee04b698ec86564ec02229c0bee848dfbf364c58/header.jpg?t=1757887406","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257191432,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257191432/movie480.mp4?t=1757088974","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257191432/movie_max.mp4?t=1757088974"},"name":"Battle Babes 4 Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257191432/15323522f764539803d80b3edf0d556f840b1466/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1757088974","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257191432/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1757088974","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257191432/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1757088974"}}],"name":"Battle Babes 4","package_groups":